<h2>Core Framework Modules</h2>
<div class="ql-grid">
  <a href="instruments.html" class="ql-card">
    <div class="ql-card-icon">📈</div>
    <div class="ql-card-title">Financial Instruments</div>
    <div class="ql-card-desc">Options, swaps, bonds, forward contracts, credit derivatives, and exotic payoff structures.</div>
  </a>

  <a href="engines.html" class="ql-card">
    <div class="ql-card-icon">⚙️</div>
    <div class="ql-card-title">Pricing Engines</div>
    <div class="ql-card-desc">Analytical pricing, Black-Scholes, Heston, finite-difference solvers, and Monte Carlo engines.</div>
  </a>

  <a href="termstructures.html" class="ql-card">
    <div class="ql-card-icon">📉</div>
    <div class="ql-card-title">Term Structures</div>
    <div class="ql-card-desc">Yield curve bootstrapping, discount factors, zero rates, forward rates, and volatility surfaces.</div>
  </a>

  <a href="datetime.html" class="ql-card">
    <div class="ql-card-icon">📅</div>
    <div class="ql-card-title">Date & Time Conventions</div>
    <div class="ql-card-desc">Financial calendars for global exchanges, business day conventions, and standard day-count fractions.</div>
  </a>

  <a href="math.html" class="ql-card">
    <div class="ql-card-icon">🧮</div>
    <div class="ql-card-title">Math & Optimization</div>
    <div class="ql-card-desc">Linear algebra, 1D/multidimensional solvers, numerical integration, interpolations, and distributions.</div>
  </a>

